    "tStartMs": 148935,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Diana: In 2, in Aya 228 it says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151908,
    "dDurationMs": 4669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[2:228]  ... (In case of pregnancy,) the man's wishes shall be given priority over the woman's wishes, ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156889,
    "dDurationMs": 889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Diana: What does that mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158312,
    "dDurationMs": 5111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: It means, a couple that has been divorced, and then the woman discovers that she is pregnant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164246,
    "dDurationMs": 7387,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In that case, she tells the ex-husband, then he decides since she's carrying his baby, that he wants to reconcile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172498,
    "dDurationMs": 3236,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The woman hates his guts, she doesn't wanna go back to him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178111,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, the Quran is saying in this case"
