  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583051,
    "dDurationMs": 7915,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: As a matter of fact, they, sometimes they will say, okay, you will accept"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590966,
    "dDurationMs": 5034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "$10,000 if you sign a million dollar note, in case of divorce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596000,
    "dDurationMs": 5404,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, this, this will force, will force the husband never, never to divorce his wife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601404,
    "dDurationMs": 2217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are all kinds of playing around this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603621,
    "dDurationMs": 7494,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: But there, there are laws are stated in Quran, where it is, they call it advance and arrears."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612253,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: But it has to be between man and woman who marries, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616556,
    "dDurationMs": 4545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: But over there in Turkey, it's handled by the parents of the man and woman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621101,
    "dDurationMs": 899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Everything is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622632,
    "dDurationMs": 610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632270,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Okay, we have five more minutes for questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634885,
    "dDurationMs": 1343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're gonna stop right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636506,
    "dDurationMs": 5177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: These are the divorce laws are seen, they're very clear, and self-explanatory and very detailed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641683,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: I have another question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643000,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644000,
    "dDurationMs": 4258,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: Why did we connect the verse 34 and 35?"
    } ]
