  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660343,
    "dDurationMs": 3999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Because, because it deals, it deals with the widows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664765,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Yes, 34 and 35 (unintelligible) this concept."
