  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669822,
    "dDurationMs": 3268,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah, it does. It's connected with the widows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674867,
    "dDurationMs": 1487,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: You're in trouble Abdullah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678778,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: About the divorce again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682733,
    "dDurationMs": 8423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: I heard in some, some, you know, in fact there's many people who divorced, divorced for three times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691156,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691656,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: (unintelligible) literally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693656,
    "dDurationMs": 2512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah. It doesn't, that's not divorce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696168,
    "dDurationMs": 1143,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697311,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: That's one if he means it. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700289,
    "dDurationMs": 4711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: If he thought about it, they had to wait four months before the decision is final."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705000,
    "dDurationMs": 2311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: So, there is no such thing \"I divorce you three times\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707311,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710401,
    "dDurationMs": 1622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: They may think about it, then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712023,
    "dDurationMs": 6089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: The idea is that a man and a woman are married and the marriage doesn't work, so they go apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718612,
    "dDurationMs": 5314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, they reconcile, and they live together for a while, and then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723926,
    "dDurationMs": 3569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " it doesn't work out, so they break apart, that's two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727804,
    "dDurationMs": 6416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, they say, well, let's try again, and they reconcile and they're together for another year, and then, they break apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734220,
    "dDurationMs": 4103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, God is saying, you guys are not good for each other, I want you to try somebody else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739021,
    "dDurationMs": 2479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, on the fourth time, she has to marry somebody else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742645,
    "dDurationMs": 4929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, there are lots of movies about this in the Middle East because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747574,
    "dDurationMs": 4614,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's happens in real life and in movies that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752188,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a couple that they had three divorces,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755357,
    "dDurationMs": 3443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now she has to marry somebody else, according to the Quranic law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759156,
    "dDurationMs": 5178,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They'll say, okay, let's go out in the street and find some drunk, (unintelligible) or something, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764334,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get him to marry, marry you, and then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770534,
    "dDurationMs": 1599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this will fulfill the requirements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772133,
    "dDurationMs": 7556,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, they go out in the street and find the first transient or some bum sitting on the sidewalk or something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779689,
    "dDurationMs": 7133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they bring him in and they bring the judge and he marries the, the divorcee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786822,
    "dDurationMs": 5178,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, of course, they're guarding him all night to make sure that he's not to messing the marriage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793712,
    "dDurationMs": 8424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, the movies, the movies come in where this bum all of a sudden becomes very smart and he says, no I'm not gonna divorce her, she's my wife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803423,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, all the problems will arise from there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806815,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: So, the movie goes on and on, but it does happen in real life. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811525,
    "dDurationMs": 6899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: But you know, if this rule goes for the woman too, if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818424,
    "dDurationMs": 4576,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "man dies that they usually the case that the woman..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824490,
    "dDurationMs": 4332,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's say that the woman died, the man has to wait four months, ten days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829578,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: It doesn't account for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830888,
    "dDurationMs": 1422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: The man doesn't get pregnant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832800,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: No, no, no, this is about the..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837357,
    "dDurationMs": 4979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abdullah: leave, leave (unintelligible)\nDr. Khalifa: The idea is to clear the, any baby."
