  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880311,
    "dDurationMs": 6825,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: I must go back and talk, and mention that those people who try to deceive and get around the Quranic laws,"
    } ]
  }, {
